veryone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and everyone who lost to Rafael Nadal is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (because Coco Gauff cannot be both a male tennis player and a player who lost to Rafael Nadal), it follows that all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are not ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, Coco Gauff, who is a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, cannot be a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Since Coco Gauff is a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, and we have established that all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are not ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n   - However, this does not directly tell us whether Coco Gauff has lost to Rafael Nadal or not. We only know that she is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\nGiven the information provided, we cannot definitively conclude whether Coco Gauff has lost to Rafael Nadal or not. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n**C) Uncertain**\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
