 flying and breathing, which are not specific to monkeys.\n   - Therefore, based on the information provided, we cannot definitively say whether Rock is a monkey or not.\n\n<｜User｜>Based on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Rock is a monkey.\n# Options:.\nA) True.\nB) False.\nC) Uncertain.\n<｜Assistant｜>.\nBased on the given information, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
