ying and organizing the spaces in their home, then they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon.\n   - Remy either both goes to bed late and wakes up every day after noon and spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home, or they do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon nor spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home.\n\n2. **Identify Relevant Information**:\n   - The key piece of information that directly relates to Remy visiting the office supply store is the statement: "All people who work regularly and often at home visit the office supply store regularly."\n\n3. **Determine Remy\'s Situation**:\n   - From the context, we know that Remy either spends their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home or does not do so.\n   - Since Remy does not spend their free time tidying and organizing the spaces in their home (because they either go to bed late and wake up every day after noon or do not go to bed late and wake up every day after noon), it follows that Remy does not work regularly and often at home.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - Since Remy does not work regularly and often at home, they do not visit the office supply store regularly.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n**B) False**\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
