S provides financial aid to those who prove economic hardship, it is reasonable to conclude that there is financial aid available for the GRE test.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n**B) False**\n\nThe statement "There is no financial aid available for the GRE test" is false based on the given information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
