ation about the exact amount of financial aid Tom would receive, we cannot definitively say whether the cost of the GRE test would be below US $300. Financial aid could reduce the cost significantly, but it could also be zero if no aid is available.\n\n6. **Conclusion**: Based on the given information, we cannot conclusively determine whether the cost of the GRE test would be below US $300. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n**C) Uncertain**\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
